; 课时18 等分与点的样式
; 证据: cmdmont m00-m15 (16/16)
;  232s DDPTYPE 点样式对话框: 点大小(S)=5.0000% 相对于屏幕设置大小 -> PDSIZE -5
;  850s 对话框高亮格 = 第2行第3格 (圆内加十字) -> PDMODE 34
;  478s LINE 长度 1000 ; 520s DIVIDE 输入线段数目 5
;  553s/617s/625s/630s/637s/685s DIVIDE 10 ; 668s DIVIDE 20
;  742s/802s MEASURE 指定线段长度 100 ; 894s MEASURE 300
;  867s LINE 长度 3600 ; 871s OFFSET 指定偏移距离 1500
FILEDIA 0
OSMODE 0
PICKBOX 3
APERTURE 10
PDMODE 34
PDSIZE -5
_.ZOOM _W -600,-1600 5600,3100
_.LINE 0,900 1000,900 
_.CIRCLE 300,400 200
_.ARC 700,200 900,500 1100,200
_.RECTANG 1300,200 1900,600
_.ELLIPSE 2100,400 2700,400 150
_.PLINE 0,-200 300,0 600,-200 900,0 
_.PLINE 1300,-400 1500,-100 1700,-400 1900,-100 2100,-400 
_.PEDIT 1300,-400 _S 
_.SPLINE 2400,-400 2600,-100 2800,-400 3000,-100



_.LINE 0,-800 1000,-800 
_.SPLINE 1300,-900 1500,-600 1700,-900 1900,-600



_.LINE 3400,-1000 3400,2600 
_.OFFSET 1500 3400,0 5000,0 
_.DIVIDE 500,900 5
_.DIVIDE 500,400 10
_.DIVIDE 900,500 10
_.DIVIDE 1600,200 10
_.DIVIDE 2100,400 10
_.DIVIDE 150,-100 10
_.DIVIDE 1300,-400 20
_.DIVIDE 2400,-400 10
_.MEASURE 500,-800 100
_.MEASURE 1300,-900 100
_.MEASURE 3400,-1000 300
_.ZOOM _E
